    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "my son is 4 and has a really high fever, he's about 42 lbs. i have some children's tylenol liquid here but i can't remember how much to give him. the bottle says it's 160mg per 5mL. how many mL should i give him to get the fever down? i'm kinda panicking a bit",
